	nd commanding stage presence — the perfect late-night cap to your weekend.
	 \nThis is an 18+ event. Food and beverage service ends approximately 45 m
	inutes into the show. All sales are final. \nTicket Information\nTickets r
	ange from $25 to $70 per person. Purchase official tickets or find resale 
